window.GUIDE_DATA = {"Enhancement":{"spec":"Enhancement","role":{"es":"DPS cuerpo a cuerpo","en":"Melee DPS"},"summary":{"es":"Arma a dos manos, rayos y totems: peleás cuerpo a cuerpo mientras Stormstrike potencia tus Lightning Bolts, y Maelstrom Weapon los hace más rápidos y baratos. En Forever el Intelecto se vuelve poder de ataque y poder con hechizos por talentos, y Stormstrike vuelve cada 8 s. Es el spec más elegido: 55–60% de los builds de Shaman en talentsforever.com.","en":"Two-handed weapon, lightning and totems: you fight in melee while Stormstrike empowers your Lightning Bolts, and Maelstrom Weapon makes them faster and cheaper. In Forever, Intellect turns into attack power and spell power through talents, and Stormstrike comes back every 8 sec. It's the most picked spec: 55–60% of Shaman builds on talentsforever.com."},"mechanicalChanges":[{"change":{"es":"Armas a dos manos de base; dual wield sin confirmar","en":"Two-handed weapons baseline; dual wield unconfirmed"},"detail":{"es":"Hachas y mazas a dos manos vienen de base (por eso desapareció el talento Two-Handed Axes and Maces). En Classic Era el Shaman nunca tuvo dual wield, y en el cliente beta tampoco hay hechizo, talento ni entrenador que lo enseñe. Wowhead reporta que el spec está pensado para un arma a dos manos.","en":"Two-handed axes and maces are baseline (which is why the Two-Handed Axes and Maces talent is gone). Classic Era Shamans never had dual wield, and the beta client has no spell, talent or trainer that teaches it either. Wowhead reports the spec is designed around a two-handed weapon."},"confidence":"official","source":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/enhancement-only-uses-2-handed-weapons-in-wow-forever-enhancement-shaman-383200"},{"change":{"es":"Stormstrike: el 20% es tuyo y vuelve cada 8 s","en":"Stormstrike: the 20% is yours and it's back every 8 sec"},"detail":{"es":"Sube 20% el daño de tu próximo Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning o Earth Shock contra ese objetivo (en Classic, las siguientes 2 fuentes de daño de Naturaleza de cualquiera). 125 de maná y 8 s de CD (antes 20 s). Está en la fila 4 (nivel 25), aunque el hechizo en los archivos todavía dice nivel 40; no se probó cuál manda.","en":"Raises the damage of your next Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning or Earth Shock against that target by 20% (in Classic, the next 2 Nature damage sources from anyone). 125 mana and an 8 sec cooldown (was 20 sec). It sits on row 4 (level 25), although the spell in the files still says level 40; which one wins hasn't been tested."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"El Intelecto se vuelve poder","en":"Intellect becomes power"},"detail":{"es":"Mental Dexterity (3/3) da poder de ataque igual al 100% de tu Intelecto y abre Flurry. Mental Quickness (2/2) da poder con hechizos y curación hasta 30% de tu Intelecto. Ancestral Knowledge ahora es +10% de Intelecto (en Classic era maná).","en":"Mental Dexterity (3/3) gives attack power equal to 100% of your Intellect and opens Flurry. Mental Quickness (2/2) gives spell damage and healing up to 30% of your Intellect. Ancestral Knowledge is now +10% Intellect (in Classic it was mana)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Maelstrom Weapon (fila 6)","en":"Maelstrom Weapon (row 6)"},"detail":{"es":"Tus golpes cuerpo a cuerpo acumulan hasta 5 cargas; cada carga baja 20% (a 5/5) el tiempo de lanzamiento y el maná de tu próximo Lightning Bolt. Solo Lightning Bolt, duran 30 s, y la chance por golpe no está en los archivos.","en":"Your melee hits build up to 5 stacks; each stack cuts 20% (at 5/5) off the cast time and mana of your next Lightning Bolt. Lightning Bolt only, stacks last 30 sec, and the chance per hit isn't in the files."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Flurry, Rage of the Farseer y Spirit Weapons","en":"Flurry, Rage of the Farseer and Spirit Weapons"},"detail":{"es":"Flurry da 25% de velocidad de ataque (antes 30%). Rage of the Farseer (fila 7): +30% de velocidad de ataque por 25 s, 3 min de CD, y desde el 24 sep ya no afecta hechizos. Spirit Weapons: chance de parar y control de amenaza (−30% sin Rockbiter, más amenaza con Rockbiter).","en":"Flurry gives 25% attack speed (was 30%). Rage of the Farseer (row 7): +30% attack speed for 25 sec, 3 min cooldown, and since Sep 24 it no longer affects spells. Spirit Weapons: a chance to parry and a threat switch (−30% without Rockbiter, more threat with Rockbiter)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Quest de arma al nivel 30","en":"Level 30 weapon quest"},"detail":{"es":"Una quest exclusiva de Shaman al nivel 30 da un arma a dos manos fuerte para la etapa temprana (se reportan opciones de arma de puño o maza a dos manos).","en":"A Shaman-only quest at level 30 rewards a strong two-handed weapon for the early game (fist weapon or two-handed mace options reported)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/unlock-powerful-weapons-with-level-30-shaman-quest-in-wow-forever-383290"},{"change":{"es":"Totem de aire: Grace of Air antes que Windfury Totem","en":"Air totem: Grace of Air over Windfury Totem"},"detail":{"es":"Para vos, Windfury Totem no hace nada: tu Windfury Weapon lo anula. Grace of Air (desde el nivel 42) sí te da Agilidad, o sea crítico, que es lo que más rinde con un arma lenta a dos manos y mantiene Flurry activo. Y como en Forever los totems de aire no se apilan entre sí, ni de dos Shamans distintos, tenés que elegir uno. En el foro oficial la comunidad sostiene que Grace of Air rinde más también para el resto del grupo cuerpo a cuerpo. Es un cálculo de jugadores, todavía sin pruebas en juego: hasta el 42, Windfury Totem (desde el 32) es tu única opción de aire para el grupo.","en":"For you, Windfury Totem does nothing: your Windfury Weapon cancels it. Grace of Air (from level 42) does give you Agility, that is crit, which pays off most with a slow two-hander and keeps Flurry up. And since Forever's air totems don't stack with each other, not even from two different Shamans, you have to pick one. On the official forums the community argues Grace of Air is better for the rest of the melee group too. It's players' math, not yet tested in game: until 42, Windfury Totem (from 32) is your only air option for the group."},"confidence":"community-untested","source":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/why-grace-of-air-outperforms-windfury-totem-for-melee-in-wow-forever/2382149"}],"statPriority":{"list":["Weapon Damage","Hit","Critical Strike","Strength","Attack Power","Intellect"],"confidence":"client-data","rationale":{"es":"Este orden es el mismo con el que Equipo › Tu camino elige tus piezas: los pesos que WoWSims midió para Mejora en Forever, ajustados para levear. Primero el daño del arma (se compara por DPS). Después, por punto de ítem: índice de golpe (contra bichos de tu nivel pesa menos que contra un jefe de banda, igual rinde), crítico y Fuerza. El Intelecto vale como poder de ataque con Mental Dexterity, pero una pieza de caster te saca armadura: va detrás. La Agilidad rinde menos que la Fuerza.","en":"This is the order Equipo › Your path picks your pieces with: the weights WoWSims measured for Enhancement in Forever, adjusted for leveling. First the weapon's damage (judged by DPS). Then, per item point: hit rating (against your level it counts less than against a raid boss, still pays), crit and Strength. Intellect is attack power with Mental Dexterity, but a caster piece costs you armor: it comes after. Agility pays less than Strength."},"source":"https://github.com/wowsims/forever","forever":{"note":{"es":"Específico de Forever: con Mental Dexterity 3/3 cada punto de Intelecto es 1 de poder de ataque, Ancestral Knowledge lo sube 10% y Mental Quickness convierte hasta 30% en poder con hechizos para Earth Shock y Lightning Bolt. Los pesos de arriba ya lo cuentan (desde el nivel 17, cuando Mental Dexterity está completo).","en":"Forever-specific: with Mental Dexterity 3/3 each point of Intellect is 1 attack power, Ancestral Knowledge raises it 10%, and Mental Quickness turns up to 30% into spell power for Earth Shock and Lightning Bolt. The weights above already count it (from level 17, once Mental Dexterity is full)."},"confidence":"client-data"}},"rotation":{"level30":[{"es":"Mantené Lightning Shield y tu imbue, y Strength of Earth y Searing Totem puestos (renovalos cuando se terminen). La amenaza extra de Rockbiter importa si hay un tanque sosteniendo al objetivo.","en":"Keep Lightning Shield and your imbue up, and Strength of Earth and Searing Totem down (renew them when they run out). Rockbiter's extra threat matters if a tank is holding the target."},{"es":"Desde el 25, Stormstrike cada vez que salga: potencia tu próximo hechizo de Naturaleza.","en":"From 25, Stormstrike whenever it's up: it empowers your next Nature spell."},{"es":"Flame Shock siempre activo en un objetivo que aguante sus ticks, y Earth Shock como golpe de daño entre medio (así lo usa la simulación). Si el enemigo lanza algo peligroso, guardate uno para cortarlo.","en":"Flame Shock always up on a target that lives through its ticks, and Earth Shock as a damage hit in between (that's how the sim uses it). If the enemy casts something dangerous, keep one to interrupt it."},{"es":"Con maná de sobra, Fire Nova de relleno: también contra grupos.","en":"With mana to spare, Fire Nova as filler: against packs too."},{"es":"Al 30, compará Windfury Weapon contra el imbue que ya venías usando. Ojo: Windfury Weapon en la mano principal anula para vos el Windfury Totem.","en":"At 30, compare Windfury Weapon against the imbue you were using. Careful: Windfury Weapon on your main hand cancels Windfury Totem for you."}],"confidence":"client-data","totems":["Strength of Earth Totem","Searing Totem","Mana Spring Totem"],"source":"https://github.com/wowsims/forever/tree/master/ui/specs/shaman/enhancement","level60":[{"es":"Totems siempre arriba: Grace of Air, Strength of Earth y Searing Totem; Lightning Shield activo.","en":"Totems always up: Grace of Air, Strength of Earth and Searing Totem; Lightning Shield active."},{"es":"Stormstrike cada vez que salga.","en":"Stormstrike whenever it's up."},{"es":"Con Maelstrom Weapon en 5 cargas, Lightning Bolt (sale instantáneo y barato).","en":"With Maelstrom Weapon at 5 stacks, Lightning Bolt (instant and cheap)."},{"es":"Flame Shock siempre activo; Earth Shock de relleno; Fire Nova con Clearcasting o con maná de sobra.","en":"Flame Shock always up; Earth Shock as filler; Fire Nova on Clearcasting or with mana to spare."}],"level60Confidence":"client-data"},"gearingNotes":[{"note":{"es":"Windfury es un proc: armá el equipo para la pelea completa, no para el golpe extra más grande.","en":"Windfury is a proc: gear for the whole fight, not for the biggest extra hit."},"confidence":"classic-assumed"},{"note":{"es":"Los archivos de ítems de Forever guardan tipos y pesos de stats, todavía no los valores finales: tomá cualquier número de gear como provisorio.","en":"Forever's item files store stat types and weights, not final values yet: treat any gear number as provisional."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"note":{"es":"Los imbues duran 60 minutos (antes 5).","en":"Imbues last 60 minutes (was 5)."},"confidence":"client-data"}],"recommendedBuild":{"note":{"es":"El build 'Leveling solo' sigue la mejor estimación de la comunidad según classicwowforever.com, que aclara explícitamente que no se probó en juego. En talentsforever.com el build más armado a 60 es 18/33/0: casi todo en Enhancement hasta Rage of the Farseer, y Elemental para Concussion y Elemental Devastation.","en":"The 'Leveling solo' build follows the community's best guess according to classicwowforever.com, which explicitly says it hasn't been tested in game. On talentsforever.com the most built level-60 build is 18/33/0: nearly everything in Enhancement down to Rage of the Farseer, and Elemental for Concussion and Elemental Devastation."}},"sources":["https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/level-30-dps-overview","https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enhancement-shaman-melee-dps-pve-guide","https://classicwowforever.com/class-guides/shaman/enhancement/","https://wowforevertalents.com/shaman/builds/enhancement-11-33-0-0c2de0/","https://talentsforever.com (CC BY 4.0) — data/shaman.json","https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes","https://talentsforever.com/shaman/builds","https://github.com/wowsims/forever/tree/master/ui/specs/shaman"],"caveat":{"es":"Beta de Forever, cap en nivel 30 (oct 2026). El orden de stats y la rotación siguen a WoWSims para Forever (pesos y lista de prioridades al 60), ajustados para levear: lo mismo con lo que Equipo › Tu camino elige tus piezas. La simulación es de una pelea contra un jefe: leveando, adaptala al bicho que tengas enfrente.","en":"Forever beta, level 30 cap (Oct 2026). The stat order and the rotation follow WoWSims for Forever (weights and priority list at 60), adjusted for leveling: what Equipo › Your path picks your pieces with. The sim is a boss fight: leveling, adapt it to whatever you're fighting."},"keyTalents":[{"es":"Stormstrike (fila 4, nivel 25) — +20% a tu próximo Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning o Earth Shock, cada 8 s","en":"Stormstrike (row 4, level 25) — +20% to your next Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning or Earth Shock, every 8 sec"},{"es":"Mental Dexterity — 100% de tu Intelecto como poder de ataque; abre Flurry","en":"Mental Dexterity — 100% of your Intellect as attack power; opens Flurry"},{"es":"Maelstrom Weapon — hasta 20% menos tiempo de lanzamiento y maná por carga para Lightning Bolt","en":"Maelstrom Weapon — up to 20% less cast time and mana per stack for Lightning Bolt"},{"es":"Improved Stormstrike — 50% de regeneración de maná al lanzar hechizos por 15 s tras Stormstrike, y Stormstrike se reinicia al esquivar o parar","en":"Improved Stormstrike — 50% mana regen while casting for 15 sec after Stormstrike, and Stormstrike resets when you dodge or parry"},{"es":"Rage of the Farseer (fila 7) — +30% de velocidad de ataque por 25 s","en":"Rage of the Farseer (row 7) — +30% attack speed for 25 sec"}],"gearTargets":[{"note":{"es":"Arma: el DPS más alto que consigas, y lenta (3,3 a 3,8 s). Stormstrike y Windfury pegan por golpe, así que cada golpe grande rinde más; un arma rápida con un poco más de DPS no compensa.","en":"Weapon: the highest DPS you can get, and slow (3.3 to 3.8 sec). Stormstrike and Windfury hit per swing, so each big hit pays more; a fast weapon with slightly more DPS doesn't make up for it."},"confidence":"community-untested"},{"note":{"es":"Después del arma: índice de golpe, crítico (mantiene Flurry activo) y Fuerza (poder de ataque). La Agilidad rinde menos por punto que la Fuerza.","en":"After the weapon: hit rating, crit (keeps Flurry up) and Strength (attack power). Agility pays less per point than Strength."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"note":{"es":"Varias armas a dos manos nuevas de Forever traen Fuerza + poder con hechizos (Charged Mithril Battleaxe, Thorium Greatmace, Stormcarver): Blizzard está pensando el equipo de Enhancement con algo de poder con hechizos.","en":"Several new Forever two-handers carry Strength + spell power (Charged Mithril Battleaxe, Thorium Greatmace, Stormcarver): Blizzard is itemizing Enhancement with some spell power."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"note":{"es":"No hay un cap de índice de golpe confirmado para levear. Los pesos de stats son los que WoWSims midió para Forever al 60, ajustados para levear: los mismos que usa Equipo › Tu camino.","en":"There is no confirmed hit cap for leveling. Stat weights are the ones WoWSims measured for Forever at 60, adjusted for leveling: the same Equipo › Your path uses."},"confidence":"client-data"}]},"Elemental":{"spec":"Elemental","role":{"es":"DPS a distancia / caster","en":"Ranged DPS / caster"},"summary":{"es":"Rayos y lava desde lejos: Lava Burst pega 20% más fuerte sobre tu Flame Shock, y Lightning Overload te regala Lightning Bolts extra gratis. En Forever, Elemental Alacrity le saca 0,5 s a tus hechizos principales ya desde la fila 2, así que el ritmo es rápido desde temprano. Ojo: el daño base de los hechizos bajó mucho frente a Classic (Lightning Bolt −56% en su rango máximo) porque el poder con hechizos ahora viene del equipo desde el nivel 10, así que el equipo pesa más que nunca.","en":"Lightning and lava from range: Lava Burst hits 20% harder on your Flame Shock, and Lightning Overload throws in free extra Lightning Bolts. In Forever, Elemental Alacrity cuts 0.5 sec off your main spells as early as row 2, so the pace is fast from the start. Note: spells' base damage dropped a lot compared to Classic (Lightning Bolt −56% at its top rank) because spell power now comes from gear from level 10, so gear matters more than ever."},"mechanicalChanges":[{"change":{"es":"Lava Burst en la fila 5, y vuelve Elemental Mastery","en":"Lava Burst on row 5, and Elemental Mastery is back"},"detail":{"es":"Desde el parche del 17-oct (build 70450), Lava Burst está en la fila 5 (nivel 30) y ya no pide Lightning Overload: bolt de fuego de 2,5 s y 10 s de CD que hace 20% más con tu Flame Shock puesto; rangos 2, 3 y 4 en el entrenador a los 40, 50 y 60. Elemental Mastery vuelve como talento final (fila 7, nivel 40, pide Lava Burst), distinto al de Classic: durante 15 s le saca 0,5 s a Lightning Bolt y Lava Burst y quita el CD de Chain Lightning.","en":"Since the Oct 17 patch (build 70450), Lava Burst is on row 5 (level 30) and no longer needs Lightning Overload: a 2.5 sec Fire bolt on a 10 sec cooldown that deals 20% more with your Flame Shock up; ranks 2, 3 and 4 at the trainer at 40, 50 and 60. Elemental Mastery is back as the final talent (row 7, level 40, needs Lava Burst), unlike Classic's: for 15 sec it takes 0.5 sec off Lightning Bolt and Lava Burst and removes Chain Lightning's cooldown."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Lightning Bolt y Chain Lightning se lanzan más rápido","en":"Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning cast faster"},"detail":{"es":"Lightning Bolt rangos 4–10 se lanza en 2,5 s (Classic: 3 s); los rangos 1–3 no cambiaron. Chain Lightning rango 1 es de 2 s con 6 s de CD.","en":"Lightning Bolt ranks 4–10 cast in 2.5 sec (Classic: 3 sec); ranks 1–3 are unchanged. Chain Lightning rank 1 is a 2 sec cast with a 6 sec cooldown."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"data/shaman.json: class_abilities"},{"change":{"es":"Elemental Alacrity (ex Lightning Mastery) sube a la fila 2","en":"Elemental Alacrity (formerly Lightning Mastery) moves up to row 2"},"detail":{"es":"A 3/3 saca 0,5 s a Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning y Lava Burst: un Lightning Bolt de 2 s ya cerca del nivel 20. En Classic estaba en la fila 6 (nivel 35).","en":"At 3/3 it takes 0.5 sec off Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning and Lava Burst: a 2 sec Lightning Bolt already around level 20. In Classic it was on row 6 (level 35)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Lightning Overload es nuevo (fila 5)","en":"Lightning Overload is new (row 5)"},"detail":{"es":"Pide Elemental Alacrity 3/3. Chance de que Lightning Bolt o Chain Lightning lancen una copia gratis a la mitad de daño y sin amenaza. El tooltip y el hechizo no coinciden en la chance, y no se sabe si Lava Burst también puede activarlo.","en":"Needs Elemental Alacrity 3/3. A chance for Lightning Bolt or Chain Lightning to cast a free copy at half damage and no threat. The tooltip and the spell disagree on the chance, and it's unknown whether Lava Burst can overload."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Earthbound: Earthbind enraíza","en":"Earthbound: Earthbind roots"},"detail":{"es":"Talento nuevo de 1 punto (fila 4): Earthbind Totem inmoviliza 5 s a lo que tenga cerca al caer. La inmovilización se aplica del lado del servidor y nadie lo probó todavía.","en":"New 1-point talent (row 4): Earthbind Totem immobilizes nearby targets for 5 sec when it drops. The root is applied server-side and nobody has tested it yet."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Cambios en el resto del árbol","en":"Changes across the rest of the tree"},"detail":{"es":"Call of Thunder e Improved Fire Nova ya no existen (build 70450). Trial by Fire (fila 4, 2 puntos) es nuevo: +20% de daño a Fire Nova, 4 s menos de CD y 20 s más de Magma Totem. Elemental Fury: 5 puntos en la fila 6 (antes 1 en la 5), mismo 100%, ahora pide Lightning Overload. Concussion ya solo afecta Earth Shock de los shocks. Call of Flame suma 15% a totems de fuego, Flame Shock, Fire Nova y Lava Burst, y 9 s más de Flame Shock. Elemental Devastation sube a la fila 2 y ahora se activa con críticos de hechizos de daño directo.","en":"Call of Thunder and Improved Fire Nova are gone (build 70450). Trial by Fire (row 4, 2 points) is new: +20% Fire Nova damage, 4 sec off its cooldown and 20 sec more Magma Totem. Elemental Fury: 5 points on row 6 (was 1 on row 5), same 100%, now needs Lightning Overload. Concussion now only affects Earth Shock among the shocks. Call of Flame adds 15% to Fire totems, Flame Shock, Fire Nova and Lava Burst, and 9 sec more Flame Shock. Elemental Devastation moves up to row 2 and now triggers on direct damage spell crits."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Fire Nova es un hechizo, no un totem","en":"Fire Nova is a spell, not a totem"},"detail":{"es":"30 m de alcance, instantáneo, 10 s de CD; explota alrededor de tu totem de fuego, con el mismo daño que tenía el totem y sin la espera de 4 s.","en":"30 yd range, instant, 10 sec cooldown; blasts around your Fire totem, for the same damage the totem had and without the 4 sec fuse."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"data/shaman.json: class_abilities"}],"statPriority":{"list":["Spell Power","Hit","Critical Strike","Intellect","Mana Regeneration (MP5)"],"confidence":"client-data","rationale":{"es":"Este orden es el mismo con el que Equipo › Tu camino elige tus piezas: los pesos que WoWSims midió para Elemental en Forever (el daño de Naturaleza vale más que el de Fuego, por Lightning Bolt), ajustados para levear. El índice de golpe va antes que el crítico: un hechizo que falla no hace nada. El Intelecto y la regeneración pesan más que en una pelea de banda de tres minutos, porque leveando el maná sí se termina entre grupo y grupo.","en":"This is the order Equipo › Your path picks your pieces with: the weights WoWSims measured for Elemental in Forever (Nature damage counts more than Fire, for Lightning Bolt), adjusted for leveling. Hit comes before crit: a missed spell does nothing. Intellect and regeneration weigh more than in a three-minute raid fight, because leveling, your mana does run out between pulls."},"source":"https://github.com/wowsims/forever","alsoReported":{"list":["Spell Power","Hit","Haste","Intellect","Critical Strike"],"confidence":"community-untested","note":{"es":"Fuentes estilo Icy Veins le dan más peso al índice de golpe y la celeridad para contenido de banda. Tomalo como variante de nivel alto, cuando el gear y el cap de índice de golpe importen más que al 30.","en":"Icy Veins-style sources weight Hit/Haste higher for raid content. Treat it as a high-level variant, for when gear and the hit cap matter more than at 30."}},"forever":{"note":{"es":"Específico de Forever: el daño base bajó y Blizzard puso poder con hechizos en el equipo desde el nivel 10, empezando por las armas. El poder con hechizos del arma pesa más que en Classic. Además Lightning Bolt (rangos 4–10) escala menos, 71,4% contra 85,7%.","en":"Forever-specific: base damage dropped and Blizzard put spell power on gear from level 10, starting with weapons. Weapon spell power matters more than in Classic. Lightning Bolt (ranks 4–10) also scales less, 71.4% against 85.7%."},"confidence":"official"}},"rotation":{"level30":[{"es":"Abrí de lejos con Lightning Bolt y poné Earthbind donde te dé otra ventana de lanzamiento.","en":"Open from range with Lightning Bolt and drop Earthbind where it buys you another cast window."},{"es":"Flame Shock y Searing Totem en objetivos que vivan lo suficiente para los ticks.","en":"Flame Shock and Searing Totem on targets that live long enough for the ticks."},{"es":"Earth Shock para interrumpir o como golpe directo, y Frost Shock si el objetivo se mueve y la ralentización importa.","en":"Earth Shock to interrupt or as a direct hit, and Frost Shock when the target moves and the slow matters."},{"es":"Seguí con Lightning Bolt en un solo objetivo; Fire Nova para grupos.","en":"Keep casting Lightning Bolt on a single target; Fire Nova for packs."}],"confidence":"client-data","level60":[{"es":"Flame Shock primero y renovalo antes de que se caiga (en hasta 3 enemigos): Lava Burst hace 20% más con él puesto.","en":"Flame Shock first and renew it before it drops (on up to 3 enemies): Lava Burst deals 20% more with it on."},{"es":"Lava Burst cada vez que salga de CD.","en":"Lava Burst whenever it's off cooldown."},{"es":"Elemental Mastery cada vez que esté disponible: 15 s de Lightning Bolt y Lava Burst más rápidos y Chain Lightning sin CD.","en":"Elemental Mastery whenever it's available: 15 s of faster Lightning Bolt and Lava Burst and Chain Lightning without cooldown."},{"es":"Lightning Bolt de relleno (Lightning Overload puede lanzar uno extra gratis); contra varios, Chain Lightning, Fire Nova y Magma Totem.","en":"Lightning Bolt as filler (Lightning Overload may cast an extra one for free); against several, Chain Lightning, Fire Nova and Magma Totem."},{"es":"Con el maná por debajo de la mitad, Mana Tide Totem.","en":"Below half mana, Mana Tide Totem."}],"level60Confidence":"client-data","source":"https://github.com/wowsims/forever/tree/master/ui/specs/shaman/elemental"},"gearingNotes":[{"note":{"es":"Consumibles: Minor Arcane Elixir (+5 de daño de hechizos) y Lesser Spellblasting Potion (+11).","en":"Consumables: Minor Arcane Elixir (+5 spell damage) and Lesser Spellblasting Potion (+11)."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"note":{"es":"Encantamientos: Minor Wizard Oil (+8 de daño y curación) y Enchant Bracer - Minor Intellect (+3 Intelecto).","en":"Enchants: Minor Wizard Oil (+8 damage and healing) and Enchant Bracer - Minor Intellect (+3 Intellect)."},"confidence":"client-data"}],"keyTalents":[{"es":"Lava Burst (fila 5) — 20% más de daño con tu Flame Shock en el objetivo","en":"Lava Burst (row 5) — 20% more damage with your Flame Shock on the target"},{"es":"Lightning Overload — chance de un Lightning Bolt/Chain Lightning extra gratis, a la mitad de daño","en":"Lightning Overload — chance for a free extra Lightning Bolt/Chain Lightning at half damage"},{"es":"Elemental Alacrity — −0,5 s a Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning y Lava Burst, ya en la fila 2","en":"Elemental Alacrity — −0.5 sec on Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning and Lava Burst, already on row 2"},{"es":"Call of Flame — +15% a totems de fuego, Flame Shock, Fire Nova y Lava Burst","en":"Call of Flame — +15% to Fire totems, Flame Shock, Fire Nova and Lava Burst"},{"es":"Elemental Devastation — tus críticos de hechizo dan +9% de crítico cuerpo a cuerpo por 10 s (más útil para Enhancement)","en":"Elemental Devastation — your spell crits give +9% melee crit for 10 sec (more useful for Enhancement)"}],"recommendedBuild":{"note":{"es":"Alternativa al 30: Earthbound en vez del primer punto de Lightning Overload, para tener una inmovilización instantánea al subir de nivel solo. Se reporta que bajar a Restoration por Mindfulness + Mana Tide Totem rinde en peleas largas, pero Mana Tide está en la fila 4 (15 puntos en Resto): al 30 te deja solo 5–10 puntos en Elemental, así que en la práctica es para más nivel.","en":"Alternative at 30: Earthbound instead of Lightning Overload's first point, for an instant root while leveling solo. Dipping into Restoration for Mindfulness + Mana Tide Totem is reported to pay off in long fights, but Mana Tide sits on row 4 (15 points in Resto): at 30 it leaves only 5–10 points for Elemental, so in practice it's a higher-level option."}},"sources":["https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/level-30-dps-overview","https://www.icy-veins.com/wow/elemental-shaman-pve-dps-stat-priority","https://classicwowforever.com/class-guides/shaman/elemental/","https://talentsforever.com (CC BY 4.0) — data/shaman.json","https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes","https://github.com/wowsims/forever/tree/master/ui/specs/shaman"],"caveat":{"es":"Beta de Forever, cap en nivel 30 (oct 2026). El orden de stats y la rotación siguen a WoWSims para Forever (pesos y lista de prioridades al 60), ajustados para levear: lo mismo con lo que Equipo › Tu camino elige tus piezas. La simulación es de una pelea contra un jefe: leveando, adaptala al bicho que tengas enfrente.","en":"Forever beta, level 30 cap (Oct 2026). The stat order and the rotation follow WoWSims for Forever (weights and priority list at 60), adjusted for leveling: what Equipo › Your path picks your pieces with. The sim is a boss fight: leveling, adapt it to whatever you're fighting."},"gearTargets":[{"note":{"es":"Arma: un staff, o un arma de una mano con escudo u off-hand. Enchanting craftea staves BoP para casters (Glimmering Staff al 25, Radiant Staff al 45, con Intelecto).","en":"Weapon: a staff, or a one-hander with a shield or off-hand. Enchanting crafts BoP caster staves (Glimmering Staff at 25, Radiant Staff at 45, with Intellect)."},"confidence":"client-data"}]},"Restoration":{"spec":"Restoration","role":{"es":"Healer","en":"Healer"},"summary":{"es":"Sostenés al grupo con Chain Heal, Riptide y totems, y sos el spec de Shaman al que menos tocó el recorte de Forever. Las curas casi no bajaron frente a Classic (Healing Wave −7%), mientras el daño de los hechizos cayó fuerte. Riptide (fila 7, nivel 40) es cura directa más HoT y deja tu próximo Chain Heal sobre ese objetivo 25% más fuerte, y Mana Tide Totem ahora está en la fila 4.","en":"You keep the group alive with Chain Heal, Riptide and totems, and you're the Shaman spec Forever's cuts touched least. Heals barely dropped compared to Classic (Healing Wave −7%), while spell damage fell hard. Riptide (row 7, level 40) is a direct heal plus HoT and makes your next Chain Heal on that target 25% stronger, and Mana Tide Totem now sits on row 4."},"mechanicalChanges":[{"change":{"es":"Riptide es el nuevo final del árbol","en":"Riptide is the new bottom of the tree"},"detail":{"es":"Instantáneo, 6 s de CD: cura, agrega un HoT de 15 s y sube 25% los Chain Heal que lances directo sobre ese objetivo. Según las notas de Blizzard puede ser crítico. Fila 7 (nivel 40), rangos 2 y 3 a los 50 y 60.","en":"Instant, 6 sec cooldown: heals, adds a 15 sec HoT and raises the Chain Heals you cast directly on that target by 25%. Per Blizzard's notes it can crit. Row 7 (level 40), ranks 2 and 3 at 50 and 60."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Water Shield es un talento (fila 3)","en":"Water Shield is a talent (row 3)"},"detail":{"es":"3 globos: cuando te pegan o una cura tuya es crítica, recuperás 2% de tu maná máximo (un globo cada pocos segundos). Dura 10 min. Desde la build 70291 no tiene tiempo de reutilización. Solo un escudo elemental a la vez; ningún entrenador lo vende.","en":"3 globes: when you're hit or one of your heals crits, you regain 2% of your maximum mana (one globe every few seconds). Lasts 10 min. Since build 70291 it has no cooldown. Only one elemental shield at a time; no trainer sells it."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Mindfulness y Healing Way","en":"Mindfulness and Healing Way"},"detail":{"es":"Mindfulness (nuevo, fila 2): a 3/3, 50% de tu regeneración de maná sigue mientras lanzás hechizos; en Classic el Shaman no tenía nada así. Healing Way ahora da +25% plano a Healing Wave desde la primera (antes acumulaba 6% hasta 3 veces).","en":"Mindfulness (new, row 2): at 3/3, 50% of your mana regeneration continues while casting; Classic Shamans had nothing like it. Healing Way now gives a flat +25% to Healing Wave from the first one (it used to stack 6% up to 3 times)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Mana Tide Totem sube a la fila 4 (nivel 25)","en":"Mana Tide Totem moves up to row 4 (level 25)"},"detail":{"es":"Antes estaba al final del árbol (nivel 40). Llega a 30 m; el rango 1 da 88 de maná cada 3 s (antes 170) y el rango 3 sigue en 290.","en":"It used to be at the bottom of the tree (level 40). Reaches 30 yards; rank 1 gives 88 mana every 3 sec (was 170) and rank 3 stays at 290."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"El índice de golpe sale de Tidal Focus","en":"Hit comes from Tidal Focus"},"detail":{"es":"Nature's Guidance ya no existe: el único índice de golpe del árbol es Tidal Focus (5% a 5/5, fila 1 desde el build 70450). Tidal Mastery ya no da crítico a Lightning Bolt ni a Chain Lightning. Healing Focus llega al mismo 70% en 3 rangos (antes 5).","en":"Nature's Guidance is gone: the only hit in the tree is Tidal Focus (5% at 5/5, row 1 since build 70450). Tidal Mastery no longer adds crit to Lightning Bolt or Chain Lightning. Healing Focus reaches the same 70% in 3 ranks (was 5)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"}],"statPriority":{"list":["Healing Power","Mana Regeneration (MP5)","Intellect","Spirit","Critical Strike"],"confidence":"classic-assumed","rationale":{"es":"Este orden es el mismo con el que Equipo › Tu camino elige tus piezas. WoWSims todavía no tiene pesos para Restauración en Forever: son los habituales de Classic. El poder de curación mejora cada cura; la regeneración (MP5) y el Intelecto sostienen el maná, y Mindfulness hace que el Espíritu rinda mientras lanzás. Tené suficiente Aguante para que un golpe suelto no te interrumpa una cura.","en":"This is the order Equipo › Your path picks your pieces with. WoWSims has no Restoration weights for Forever yet: these are Classic's usual ones. Healing power improves every heal; regeneration (MP5) and Intellect sustain your mana, and Mindfulness makes Spirit pay off while casting. Keep enough Stamina that a stray hit doesn't interrupt a heal."},"source":"https://github.com/wowsims/forever","forever":{"note":{"es":"Específico de Forever: las curas bajaron poco (Healing Wave −7%, Chain Heal −17%) y los rangos bajos de Healing Wave escalan más con poder con hechizos que en Classic. Con Mindfulness 3/3 y Water Shield, la regeneración vale más que en Classic.","en":"Forever-specific: heals barely dropped (Healing Wave −7%, Chain Heal −17%) and low Healing Wave ranks scale more with spell power than in Classic. With Mindfulness 3/3 and Water Shield, regeneration is worth more than in Classic."},"confidence":"client-data"}},"rotation":{"priority":[{"es":"Water Shield mientras curás, y un Mana Spring Totem útil desde el nivel 26.","en":"Water Shield while healing, and a useful Mana Spring Totem from level 26."},{"es":"Healing Wave cuando hay tiempo para el lanzamiento largo; Lesser Healing Wave si esperar ese lanzamiento pone en riesgo al objetivo.","en":"Healing Wave when there's time for the long cast; Lesser Healing Wave if waiting for that cast puts the target at risk."},{"es":"Healing Stream para daño de grupo constante; Tremor o un totem de limpieza cuando los efectos del enemigo lo justifiquen.","en":"Healing Stream for steady group damage; Tremor or a cleansing totem when the enemy's effects call for it."},{"es":"Desde el 25, Mana Tide donde el grupo pueda quedarse en rango. Al 30, guardá Nature's Swiftness para una cura urgente o para curar en movimiento.","en":"From 25, Mana Tide where the group can stay in range. At 30, save Nature's Swiftness for an urgent heal or for healing on the move."},{"es":"Al 40, Riptide al tanque y después Chain Heal directo sobre él.","en":"At 40, Riptide the tank and then Chain Heal directly on them."}],"confidence":"classic-assumed","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/class-guides/shaman/restoration/"},"gearingNotes":[{"note":{"es":"Los críticos de curación pueden consumir globos de Water Shield: revisalo en pulls largos y renovalo.","en":"Healing crits can consume Water Shield globes: check it during long pulls and refresh it."},"confidence":"classic-assumed"},{"note":{"es":"Enchant Bracer - Minor Healing Power: +8 de curación en muñecas, permanente.","en":"Enchant Bracer - Minor Healing Power: +8 healing on bracers, permanent."},"confidence":"client-data"}],"keyTalents":[{"es":"Riptide (fila 7) — cura + HoT, y Chain Heal 25% más fuerte sobre ese objetivo","en":"Riptide (row 7) — heal + HoT, and a 25% stronger Chain Heal on that target"},{"es":"Nature's Swiftness — tu próximo hechizo de Naturaleza de menos de 10 s sale instantáneo","en":"Nature's Swiftness — your next Nature spell under 10 sec becomes instant"},{"es":"Water Shield — 2% de maná por globo al recibir golpes o con curas críticas","en":"Water Shield — 2% mana per globe when you're hit or your heals crit"},{"es":"Mana Tide Totem — maná para el grupo, ya en la fila 4","en":"Mana Tide Totem — mana for the group, now on row 4"},{"es":"Mindfulness — 50% de regeneración de maná mientras lanzás hechizos, a 3/3","en":"Mindfulness — 50% mana regen while casting at 3/3"}],"recommendedBuild":{"note":{"es":"El build 'Healer de mazmorras' sigue la mejor estimación de la comunidad, que aclara explícitamente que no se probó en juego. En talentsforever.com el build de Resto más armado a 60 es 0/10/41.","en":"The 'Dungeon healer' build follows the community's best guess, which explicitly says it hasn't been tested in game. On talentsforever.com the most built Resto level-60 build is 0/10/41."}},"sources":["https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/level-30-healer-overview","https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/restoration-shaman-healer-pve-guide","https://classicwowforever.com/class-guides/shaman/restoration/","https://talentsforever.com (CC BY 4.0) — data/shaman.json","https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"],"caveat":{"es":"Beta de Forever, cap en nivel 30 (oct 2026). WoWSims todavía no tiene pesos para Restauración en Forever: el orden de stats es el habitual de Classic, el mismo con el que Equipo › Tu camino elige tus piezas. La rotación viene de classicwowforever.com, que la etiqueta 'asumida de Classic': nada en el cliente beta la contradice, pero no está confirmada. Tomala como punto de partida.","en":"Forever beta, level 30 cap (Oct 2026). WoWSims has no Restoration weights for Forever yet: the stat order is Classic's usual one, the same Equipo › Your path picks your pieces with. The rotation comes from classicwowforever.com, which labels it 'assumed from Classic': nothing in the beta client contradicts it, but it isn't confirmed. Treat it as a starting point."},"gearTargets":[{"note":{"es":"Arma: un staff, o un arma de una mano con escudo u off-hand. Enchanting craftea staves BoP con Espíritu (Soulstaff al 25, Dreamstaff al 45) y el totem Polished Driftwood Icon (reliquia, 20).","en":"Weapon: a staff, or a one-hander with a shield or off-hand. Enchanting crafts BoP Spirit staves (Soulstaff at 25, Dreamstaff at 45) and the Polished Driftwood Icon totem (relic, 20)."},"confidence":"client-data"}]},"Overview":{"classNotes":[{"fact":{"es":"La beta tiene tope en nivel 30 (21 puntos de talento) desde la build 70170 del 1 oct 2026. Los árboles cuentan hasta el 60 (51 puntos).","en":"The beta has been capped at level 30 (21 talent points) since build 70170 on Oct 1, 2026. The trees count up to level 60 (51 points)."},"confidence":"official"},{"fact":{"es":"Progresión de armadura: Cuero hasta nivel 40, luego Malla.","en":"Armor progression: Leather until level 40, then Mail."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Recurso: Mana (sin cambios vs Classic Era).","en":"Resource: Mana (unchanged from Classic Era)."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Talentos: 50 (Classic tenía 46). 12 nuevos, 30 cambiados, 3 movidos y 5 iguales; 8 talentos de Classic ya no existen.","en":"Talents: 50 (Classic had 46). 12 new, 30 changed, 3 moved and 5 unchanged; 8 Classic talents are gone."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Spellbook: 10 hechizos nuevos, 9 rehechos y 22 con números nuevos respecto de Classic. Todo en el tab Spellbook.","en":"Spellbook: 10 new spells, 9 reworked and 22 with new numbers compared to Classic. All of it in the Spellbook tab."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Ningún árbol es de tanque, pero Enhancement tiene piezas: Spirit Weapons (parada y +30% de amenaza con Rockbiter activo), Anticipation (+6% de esquiva) y Toughness (+10% de Aguante). Shield Specialization ya no existe.","en":"No tree is a tank tree, but Enhancement has the pieces: Spirit Weapons (parry and +30% threat with Rockbiter active), Anticipation (+6% dodge) and Toughness (+10% Stamina). Shield Specialization is gone."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Dual wield: ningún hechizo, talento ni entrenador lo enseña en el cliente beta, y nadie reportó haberlo probado. No está descartado, solo sin confirmar.","en":"Dual wield: no spell, talent or trainer in the beta client teaches it, and nobody has reported trying it. Not ruled out, just unconfirmed."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Hachas y mazas a dos manos ahora vienen de base (por eso desapareció el talento Two-Handed Axes and Maces).","en":"Two-handed axes and maces are now baseline (which is why the Two-Handed Axes and Maces talent is gone)."},"confidence":"official"},{"fact":{"es":"Dual spec se desbloquea al nivel 40 (inalcanzable en la beta). El respec se hace en el entrenador de clase de una ciudad grande, e incluye los talentos de Legacy.","en":"Dual spec unlocks at level 40 (out of reach in the beta). Respec happens at the class trainer in a major city, and includes Legacy talents."},"confidence":"official"},{"fact":{"es":"Costo de entrenador hasta nivel 60 ronda los 194g (precio heredado de Classic).","en":"Trainer costs up to level 60 are around 194g (price carried over from Classic)."},"confidence":"classic-assumed"}],"races":{"note":{"es":"5 razas pueden ser Shaman. Dos son nuevas para la clase: Dwarf (la única opción Alliance) y Skyborne (Windshaper), una raza Horde nueva en WoW: Forever que se entrena con Shenthul en Orgrimmar. Racials leídos del cliente beta.","en":"5 races can be a Shaman. Two are new to the class: Dwarf (the only Alliance option) and Skyborne (Windshaper), a Horde race new in WoW: Forever that trains with Shenthul in Orgrimmar. Racials read from the beta client."},"confidence":"client-data","newToShaman":["Dwarf","Skyborne (Windshaper)"]},"sources":["https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes","https://talentsforever.com/launch","https://talentsforever.com/shaman/questions","https://classicwowforever.com/class-guides/shaman/","https://classicwowforever.com/sources/","https://talentsforever.com (CC BY 4.0) — data/shaman.json"],"caveat":{"es":"classicwowforever.com distingue explícitamente entre dato probado en juego, dato del cliente beta, comportamiento asumido de Classic Era, y reporte de comunidad sin confirmar. Todo lo de esta página está etiquetado con ese mismo criterio (campo confidence) — beta, puede cambiar.","en":"classicwowforever.com explicitly separates in-game tested facts, beta client data, behavior assumed from Classic Era, and unconfirmed community reports. Everything on this page is labeled with that same scheme (the confidence field) — it's a beta, it can change."},"timeline":[{"date":{"es":"17 sep 2026","en":"Sep 17, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Abre la beta.","en":"The beta opens."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"24 sep 2026","en":"Sep 24, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Build 70009: 10 cambios a Shaman. Elemental Fury y Elemental Alacrity cambian de fila, Rage of the Farseer deja de afectar hechizos, y las notas dicen que Riptide puede ser crítico y que Windfury, Grace of Air y Tranquil Air ya no se apilan.","en":"Build 70009: 10 Shaman changes. Elemental Fury and Elemental Alacrity swap rows, Rage of the Farseer stops affecting spells, and the notes say Riptide can crit and that Windfury, Grace of Air and Tranquil Air no longer stack."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"1 oct 2026","en":"Oct 1, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Build 70170: cap a nivel 30. Un cambio a Shaman: Disease Cleansing Totem pasa de 2 a 5 minutos.","en":"Build 70170: level 30 cap. One Shaman change: Disease Cleansing Totem goes from 2 to 5 minutes."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"date":{"es":"8 oct 2026","en":"Oct 8, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Build 70291: Water Shield pierde su reutilización de 15 s, Lightning Bolt rango 1 baja a 14–16, y Mana Tide Totem pasa a nivel 25 en los archivos.","en":"Build 70291: Water Shield loses its 15 sec cooldown, Lightning Bolt rank 1 drops to 14–16, and Mana Tide Totem moves to level 25 in the files."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"date":{"es":"17 oct 2026","en":"Oct 17, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Build 70450: nuevo árbol Elemental. Se van Call of Thunder e Improved Fire Nova, llegan Trial by Fire y Elemental Mastery (talento final), Lava Burst sube a la fila 5; en Restoration, Tidal Focus y Totemic Focus cambian de fila. Fire Nova hace casi la mitad de daño y los totems de grupo pasan a afectar a la banda.","en":"Build 70450: new Elemental tree. Call of Thunder and Improved Fire Nova are gone, Trial by Fire and Elemental Mastery (final talent) arrive, Lava Burst moves up to row 5; in Restoration, Tidal Focus and Totemic Focus swap rows. Fire Nova deals about half the damage and party totems now affect the raid."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"date":{"es":"21 oct 2026","en":"Oct 21, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Termina la beta.","en":"The beta ends."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"4 nov 2026","en":"Nov 4, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Lanzamiento global de WoW: Forever, 15:00 PST (23:00 UTC).","en":"Global launch of WoW: Forever, 3:00 p.m. PST (23:00 UTC)."},"confidence":"official"}],"totems":{"notes":[{"fact":{"es":"La mayoría de los totems dura 5 minutos (antes 2; Healing Stream y Mana Spring, 1) y los de grupo llegan a 30 m, que es lo que daba Totemic Mastery (ese talento ya no existe).","en":"Most totems last 5 minutes (was 2; Healing Stream and Mana Spring, 1) and party totems reach 30 yards, which is what Totemic Mastery used to give (that talent is gone)."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Mantienen su duración de Classic: Earthbind, Grounding, Stoneclaw, Searing, Magma, Mana Tide y Sentry.","en":"These keep their Classic duration: Earthbind, Grounding, Stoneclaw, Searing, Magma, Mana Tide and Sentry."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Siguen haciendo falta los cuatro ítems de totem: cada totem pide el de su elemento (Tools: Earth/Fire/Water/Air Totem).","en":"You still need the four totem items: each totem asks for its element's (Tools: Earth/Fire/Water/Air Totem)."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Call of the Elements (nivel 20, 3 s de lanzamiento) baja hasta 4 totems de tu barra de totems de una. Call of the Ancestors (30) y Call of the Spirits (40) son un 2º y 3er set guardado.","en":"Call of the Elements (level 20, 3 sec cast) drops up to 4 totems from your Totem Bar at once. Call of the Ancestors (30) and Call of the Spirits (40) are a 2nd and 3rd saved set."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Totemic Recall (20) levanta tus totems y te devuelve 25% del maná de cada uno. Totemic Projection (22) los mueve hasta 30 m.","en":"Totemic Recall (20) picks your totems back up and returns 25% of each one's mana. Totemic Projection (22) moves them up to 30 yards."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Fire Nova ahora es un hechizo (nivel 12, instantáneo, 10 s de CD) que explota alrededor de tu totem de fuego. Fire Nova Totem ya no existe.","en":"Fire Nova is now a spell (level 12, instant, 10 sec cooldown) that blasts around your Fire totem. Fire Nova Totem is gone."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Windfury, Grace of Air y Tranquil Air ya no se apilan entre sí, ni siquiera de dos Shamans distintos. Flametongue Totem no se apila con Flametongue Weapon ni con Windfury Totem.","en":"Windfury, Grace of Air and Tranquil Air no longer stack with each other, not even from two different Shamans. Flametongue Totem doesn't stack with Flametongue Weapon or Windfury Totem."},"confidence":"official"},{"fact":{"es":"Los imbues de arma duran 60 minutos (eran 5). Windfury o Flametongue Weapon en la mano principal anulan, solo para vos, el totem del mismo nombre.","en":"Weapon imbues last 60 minutes (was 5). Windfury or Flametongue Weapon on your main hand cancels, for you only, the totem of the same name."},"confidence":"client-data"}],"changed":[{"totem":"Strength of Earth Totem","rank":{"es":"Rango 5","en":"Rank 5"},"classic":{"es":"+77 Fuerza","en":"+77 Strength"},"forever":{"es":"+53 Fuerza","en":"+53 Strength"},"pct":-31},{"totem":"Grace of Air Totem","rank":{"es":"Rango 3","en":"Rank 3"},"classic":{"es":"+77 Agilidad","en":"+77 Agility"},"forever":{"es":"+89 Agilidad","en":"+89 Agility"},"pct":16},{"totem":"Windfury Totem","rank":{"es":"Rango 3","en":"Rank 3"},"classic":{"es":"+315 AP, cualquier golpe","en":"+315 AP, any hit"},"forever":{"es":"+246 AP, solo mano principal","en":"+246 AP, main hand only"},"pct":-22},{"totem":"Flametongue Totem","rank":{"es":"Rango 4","en":"Rank 4"},"classic":{"es":"15,8–48,7 de fuego","en":"15.8–48.7 Fire"},"forever":{"es":"17–55 de fuego","en":"17–55 Fire"},"pct":12},{"totem":"Healing Stream Totem","rank":{"es":"Rango 5","en":"Rank 5"},"classic":{"es":"14 cada 2 s","en":"14 every 2 sec"},"forever":{"es":"11 cada 2 s","en":"11 every 2 sec"},"pct":-21}],"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},"damage":{"spells":[["Lightning Bolt","Rank 10"],["Chain Lightning","Rank 4"],["Earth Shock","Rank 7"],["Frost Shock","Rank 4"],["Healing Wave","Rank 10"],["Lesser Healing Wave","Rank 6"],["Chain Heal","Rank 3"]],"notes":[{"fact":{"es":"Por qué: Blizzard puso poder con hechizos en el equipo desde el nivel 10, empezando por las armas, y bajó el daño base de los hechizos en lo que suelen dar los verdes de quest (WoW: Forever Podcast, ep. 2).","en":"Why: Blizzard put spell power on gear from level 10, starting with weapons, and lowered spells' base damage by what typical questing greens give (WoW: Forever Podcast, ep. 2)."},"confidence":"official"},{"fact":{"es":"Lightning Bolt (rangos 4–10) pasó de 85,7% a 71,4% de coeficiente y Chain Lightning de 71,4% a ~57%. En cambio los rangos bajos ganaron coeficiente: Lightning Bolt 1–3, Healing Wave 1–4 y Earth Shock 1–3 escalan más con poder con hechizos que en Classic.","en":"Lightning Bolt (ranks 4–10) went from an 85.7% to a 71.4% coefficient and Chain Lightning from 71.4% to ~57%. Low ranks, on the other hand, gained coefficient: Lightning Bolt 1–3, Healing Wave 1–4 and Earth Shock 1–3 scale more with spell power than in Classic."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Las curas casi no bajaron (Healing Wave −7%), así que Restoration es el spec menos afectado por el cambio.","en":"Heals barely dropped (Healing Wave −7%), so Restoration is the spec least affected by the change."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Si algo más (gear, talentos, buffs) compensa la diferencia en juego, todavía nadie lo midió.","en":"Whether anything else (gear, talents, buffs) makes up the difference in play, nobody has measured yet."},"confidence":"community-untested"}],"source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"}},"Professions":{"spec":"Professions","intro":{"es":"En Forever las profesiones son mucho más que en Classic: hay más de 800 recetas nuevas, y Leatherworking, Tailoring y Blacksmithing tienen sets raros que se ligan al recogerlos (BoP) en casi todos los rangos de nivel. Para un Shaman, eso las vuelve parte de la progresión de equipo mientras subís de nivel, no solo una forma de hacer oro.","en":"In Forever, professions are much more than in Classic: there are over 800 new recipes, and Leatherworking, Tailoring and Blacksmithing have rare bind-on-pickup (BoP) sets in nearly every level bracket. For a Shaman that makes them part of your gear progression while leveling, not just a way to make gold."},"pairs":[{"specs":["Enhancement"],"pair":"Leatherworking + Skinning","when":{"es":"Recomendado, del 1 al 60","en":"Recommended, 1 to 60"},"why":{"es":"Es la única profesión que te viste todo el leveo. Hasta el 40 hace sets raros BoP de cuero con Fuerza y Agilidad: Brawler's y Defender's (12–25), Warden's, Skulker's y Prowler's (30–50), con patrones por 30 a 90 de Merchant's Favor. Desde el 40, cuando el Shaman pasa a malla, Leatherworking también la fabrica: el cliente beta tiene 115 piezas de malla raras o mejores de Leatherworking entre el 40 y el 60 (Dragonscale, Skirmisher's y otras), así que no hace falta pasarse a Blacksmithing. Skinning abastece el cuero y su objeto de campamento, Camp Chair, da +2% de crítico al grupo. The Forever Era cuenta 5 piezas de Leatherworking en el mejor equipo de Enhancement al 20 y 6 al 30.","en":"It's the one profession that gears you through all of leveling. Up to 40 it makes rare BoP leather sets with Strength and Agility: Brawler's and Defender's (12–25), Warden's, Skulker's and Prowler's (30–50), with patterns for 30 to 90 Merchant's Favor. From 40, when Shamans move to mail, Leatherworking makes that too: the beta client has 115 rare or better Leatherworking mail pieces between 40 and 60 (Dragonscale, Skirmisher's and more), so there's no need to switch to Blacksmithing. Skinning supplies the leather and its camp object, Camp Chair, gives the group +2% crit. The Forever Era counts 5 Leatherworking pieces in Enhancement's best level-20 gear and 6 at 30."},"tldr":{"es":"La mejor opción: te viste en cuero hasta el 40 y en malla del 40 al 60, sin cambiar de profesión.","en":"The best pick: leather gear up to 40 and mail from 40 to 60, without switching professions."}},{"specs":["Enhancement"],"pair":"Blacksmithing + Mining","when":{"es":"Solo si querés fabricar tus armas","en":"Only to make your own weapons"},"why":{"es":"Blacksmithing hace hachas y mazas a dos manos con Fuerza + poder con hechizos, pero la mayoría se liga al equiparse (BoE) y se compra en la Casa de Subastas: Charged Mithril Battleaxe (43), Stormcarver (58, planos con Timbermaw Hold en Revered) y Forest Defender's Axe (60, épica). Solo Thorium Greatmace (50, planos por 90 de Favor) es BoP. Sus sets de malla BoP están casi todos entre el 10 y el 39, cuando el Shaman todavía usa cuero, así que mientras subís te da poco. Mining aporta Lodestone al campamento (+12 a +90 de poder de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo). Las profesiones no se cambian a mitad de camino: si la elegís, que sea desde el principio.","en":"Blacksmithing makes two-handed axes and maces with Strength + spell power, but most bind on equip (BoE) and can be bought on the Auction House: Charged Mithril Battleaxe (43), Stormcarver (58, plans from Timbermaw Hold at Revered) and Forest Defender's Axe (60, epic). Only Thorium Greatmace (50, plans for 90 Favor) is BoP. Its BoP mail sets sit almost all between 10 and 39, while Shamans still wear leather, so it gives little while leveling. Mining adds Lodestone to camp (+12 to +90 melee attack power). You don't switch professions halfway: if you pick it, pick it from the start."},"tldr":{"es":"No muy recomendable para Shaman: sus sets de malla llegan antes de que puedas usar malla, y casi todas sus armas se pueden comprar. Solo si querés fabricarte el arma.","en":"Not very recommended for Shaman: its mail sets come before you can wear mail, and most of its weapons can be bought. Only if you want to make your own weapon."}},{"specs":["Elemental","Restoration"],"pair":"Leatherworking + Skinning","when":{"es":"Recomendado, del 1 al 60","en":"Recommended, 1 to 60"},"why":{"es":"Los sets de caster de Leatherworking cubren todo el leveo: Stormrider's, Totemic, Trapper's y Wisdom's (12–25), y Skycaller's y Mender's (30–50). Desde el 40 también hace malla: de las 115 piezas de malla raras o mejores que tiene entre el 40 y el 60, 59 llevan stats de caster o híbridas (Mender's, Skycaller's, Glowing Hyperconductive Scale). Casi todas son BoP, con patrones por Merchant's Favor. classicwowforever la marca como la mejor combinación para Shaman. The Forever Era la pone primera para Shaman: Leatherworking es la profesión con más piezas en el mejor equipo del Shaman (37), y Overgear la recomienda para Restoration.","en":"Leatherworking's caster sets cover all of leveling: Stormrider's, Totemic, Trapper's and Wisdom's (12–25), then Skycaller's and Mender's (30–50). From 40 it makes mail too: of its 115 rare or better mail pieces between 40 and 60, 59 carry caster or hybrid stats (Mender's, Skycaller's, Glowing Hyperconductive Scale). Nearly all are BoP, with patterns for Merchant's Favor. classicwowforever rates it the best pair for Shaman. The Forever Era lists it first for Shaman: Leatherworking has the most pieces in Shaman best-in-slot gear (37), and Overgear recommends it for Restoration."},"tldr":{"es":"La más recomendada también para casters: sets de cuero con Intelecto y poder con hechizos hasta el 40, y malla de caster del 40 al 60.","en":"The most recommended for casters too: leather sets with Intellect and spell power up to 40, and caster mail from 40 to 60."}},{"specs":["Elemental","Restoration"],"pair":"Enchanting + Tailoring","when":{"es":"Alternativa sin recolectar","en":"Alternative with no gathering"},"why":{"es":"Enchanting craftea las mejores armas de caster tempranas, y son BoP, así que solo las usa el que las hace: Glimmering Staff (25, Intelecto y +34 de poder con hechizos), Soulstaff (25, Espíritu), Radiant Staff (45, +56) y Dreamstaff (45). Las fórmulas cuestan 45 de Favor. También hace los totems de reliquia (Polished Driftwood Icon al 20), Enchant Bracer – Minor Healing Power (Enchanting 90) y Minor Mana Oil (150, nivel 20: maná cada 5 s y +10 de curación), que classicwowforever recomienda para Restoration. lfcarry propone Alchemy + Enchanting para Restoration. Ninguna de las dos necesita recolectar, y se pueden subir comprando materiales. Tailoring tiene sets de tela BoP de caster en cada rango, pero ninguna guía la recomienda para Shaman: es tela y perdés armadura frente al cuero o la malla.","en":"Enchanting crafts the best early caster weapons, and they're BoP, so only the maker uses them: Glimmering Staff (25, Intellect and +34 spell power), Soulstaff (25, Spirit), Radiant Staff (45, +56) and Dreamstaff (45). Formulas cost 45 Favor. It also makes relic totems (Polished Driftwood Icon at 20), Enchant Bracer – Minor Healing Power (Enchanting 90) and Minor Mana Oil (150, level 20: mana every 5 sec and +10 healing), which classicwowforever recommends for Restoration. lfcarry suggests Alchemy + Enchanting for Restoration. Neither needs gathering, and both can be leveled by buying materials. Tailoring has BoP caster cloth sets in every bracket, but no guide recommends it for Shaman: it's cloth and you give up armor compared to leather or mail."},"tldr":{"es":"Por Enchanting, no por Tailoring: hace staves de caster BoP muy fuertes y encantamientos de curación. Tailoring es tela y el Shaman pierde armadura; sirve para alimentar Enchanting.","en":"For Enchanting, not Tailoring: it makes very strong BoP caster staves and healing enchants. Tailoring is cloth and Shamans lose armor; it feeds Enchanting."}},{"specs":["Enhancement","Elemental","Restoration"],"pair":"Herbalism + Alchemy","when":{"es":"Alternativa: oro y consumibles","en":"Alternative: gold and consumables"},"why":{"es":"No hace equipo, pero es la combinación más barata para un primer personaje: no comprás materiales y vendés hierbas y pociones. Suma dos buffs de campamento: Mana Well (Alchemy, maná cada 5 s) e Incense Candle (Herbalism, Intelecto), útiles para los tres specs porque todos dependen del maná. Ojo: en Forever las pociones de curación pasaron a First Aid, y la racial de Tauren hace que juntar hierbas de zonas altas sea posible desde muy bajo nivel. Si la elegís, el equipo sale de quests y dungeons, y los crafteos que se pueden comerciar, de la Casa de Subastas. classicwowforever la elige para raids (frascos, elixires y pociones al 60), y para Restoration suma Minor Cleric's Elixir (nivel 5, +10 de curación), Lesser Mender's Potion (15) y Elixir of Wisdom (10, +6 de Intelecto).","en":"It makes no gear, but it's the cheapest pair for a first character: you buy no materials and sell herbs and potions. It adds two camp buffs: Mana Well (Alchemy, mana every 5 sec) and Incense Candle (Herbalism, Intellect), useful for all three specs since all of them run on mana. Note: in Forever healing potions moved to First Aid, and the Tauren racial lets you gather high-zone herbs from very low level. If you pick it, your gear comes from quests and dungeons, and tradeable crafts from the Auction House. classicwowforever picks it for raiding (flasks, elixirs and potions at 60), and for Restoration adds Minor Cleric's Elixir (level 5, +10 healing), Lesser Mender's Potion (15) and Elixir of Wisdom (10, +6 Intellect)."},"tldr":{"es":"Oro y consumibles, sin equipo. classicwowforever la recomienda para raids al 60.","en":"Gold and consumables, no gear. classicwowforever recommends it for raiding at 60."}},{"specs":["Enhancement","Elemental","Restoration"],"pair":"Engineering + Mining","when":{"es":"Utilidad y PvP","en":"Utility and PvP"},"why":{"es":"Engineering hace poco equipo para Shaman: unos 50 ítems usables y solo 5 raros BoP. Su valor está en la utilidad (bombas, dispositivos, Repair Bot) y en PvP. Mining suma Lodestone al campamento. Es una elección por estilo de juego, no por progresión de equipo.","en":"Engineering makes little Shaman gear: about 50 usable items and only 5 rare BoP ones. Its value is utility (bombs, devices, Repair Bot) and PvP. Mining adds Lodestone to camp. It's a playstyle pick, not a gear-progression one."},"tldr":{"es":"Por diversión y PvP, no por equipo.","en":"For fun and PvP, not for gear."}}],"pairsNote":{"es":"Recomendaciones del sitio, armadas con lo que cada profesión craftea según el cliente beta, los buffs de campamento y lo que comentan los jugadores en el foro oficial de la beta (la estrategia que se impone es tomar la profesión que craftea tu tipo de armadura). En Equipo podés marcar tus profesiones para ver solo las armas que podés conseguir. Ninguna recomendación está probada en juego a nivel alto; la beta está topada en 30.","en":"Site recommendations, built from what each profession crafts according to the beta client, the camp buffs, and what players say on the official beta forum (the emerging strategy is to take the profession that crafts your armor type). On the Gear page you can mark your professions to see only weapons you can get. None are tested in game at high level; the beta is capped at 30."},"systems":[{"title":{"es":"Rangos y niveles","en":"Ranks and levels"},"fact":{"es":"Apprentice desde nivel 5 (tope 75), Journeyman desde nivel 10 y skill 50 (tope 150), Expert desde nivel 20 y skill 125 (tope 225), Artisan desde nivel 35 y skill 200 (tope 300). Cada zona inicial tiene un objeto de quest que enseña una profesión de recolección.","en":"Apprentice from level 5 (cap 75), Journeyman from level 10 and skill 50 (cap 150), Expert from level 20 and skill 125 (cap 225), Artisan from level 35 and skill 200 (cap 300). Each starting zone has a quest item that teaches a gathering profession."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview"},{"title":{"es":"Merchant's Favor","en":"Merchant's Favor"},"fact":{"es":"Moneda nueva, por personaje. Se gana llenando Waylaid Crates (cajas que caen en el mundo o se compran en la subasta): 5 a 30 de Favor por caja según rango, desde el nivel 10. Los Craftsman's Writs dan reputación, no Favor. Con Favor se compran patrones (30 sin reputación, 60 en Friendly, 90 a 120 en Honored, más para Engineering y Enchanting). Vendedores: Azeroth Commerce Authority en Three Corners (Redridge, Alianza) y Durotar Supply and Logistics al oeste de Crossroads (Barrens, Horda); venden lo mismo.","en":"New per-character currency. Earned by filling Waylaid Crates (world drops or bought on the Auction House): 5 to 30 Favor per crate by rank, from level 10. Craftsman's Writs give reputation, not Favor. Favor buys patterns (30 with no reputation, 60 at Friendly, 90 to 120 at Honored, more for Engineering and Enchanting). Vendors: Azeroth Commerce Authority at Three Corners (Redridge, Alliance) and Durotar Supply and Logistics west of Crossroads (Barrens, Horde); same stock."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://www.wow-professions.com/forever/merchants-favor-durotar-supply-azeroth-commerce"},{"title":{"es":"Campamento","en":"Camping"},"fact":{"es":"Cooking arma la fogata (Basic: 3 objetos; Journeyman: 5; Expert: 10) y cada profesión aporta un objeto con un buff de 1 hora para quien descansa cerca, aunque no tenga esa profesión. Los objetos comparten 1 hora de reutilización. Para Shaman sirven sobre todo: Camp Chair (Skinning, +2% de crítico), Lodestone (Mining, poder de ataque), Mana Well (Alchemy, maná), Incense Candle (Herbalism, Intelecto), Fish Bowl (Fishing, +8% a todos los atributos). Sharpening Wheel (Blacksmithing, Fuerza) se pisa con Strength of Earth Totem.","en":"Cooking builds the fire (Basic: 3 objects; Journeyman: 5; Expert: 10) and each profession adds an object with a 1-hour buff for anyone resting nearby, even without that profession. Objects share a 1-hour cooldown. Most useful for Shaman: Camp Chair (Skinning, +2% crit), Lodestone (Mining, attack power), Mana Well (Alchemy, mana), Incense Candle (Herbalism, Intellect), Fish Bowl (Fishing, +8% all attributes). Sharpening Wheel (Blacksmithing, Strength) overlaps with Strength of Earth Totem."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/camping/"},{"title":{"es":"Puntos de Legacy","en":"Legacy points"},"fact":{"es":"Cada profesión de crafteo (Alchemy, Blacksmithing, Enchanting, Engineering, Leatherworking, Tailoring) da 1 punto de Legacy a toda la cuenta a 150, 225 y 300 de skill: hasta 18 puntos. Subir profesiones distintas en distintos personajes suma para todos. Hay perks de profesión como Working Overtime (+4% de chance de subir skill por rango) o Bountiful Harvest (más materiales escasos al recolectar).","en":"Each crafting profession (Alchemy, Blacksmithing, Enchanting, Engineering, Leatherworking, Tailoring) gives the whole account 1 Legacy point at 150, 225 and 300 skill: up to 18 points. Leveling different professions on different characters adds up for all. There are profession perks such as Working Overtime (+4% skill-up chance per rank) or Bountiful Harvest (more scarce materials when gathering)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/legacy-perks/"},{"title":{"es":"Patrones por personaje","en":"Patterns per character"},"fact":{"es":"La mayoría de los patrones nuevos se ligan al recogerlos y el Favor es por personaje: cada personaje compra los suyos. Los sets BoP solo los usa quien los craftea.","en":"Most new patterns bind on pickup and Favor is per character: each character buys its own. BoP sets can only be used by whoever crafts them."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://www.wow-professions.com/forever/merchants-favor-durotar-supply-azeroth-commerce"}],"leveling":[{"site":"wow-professions.com","url":"https://www.wow-professions.com/forever","note":{"es":"Guías 1–300 por profesión, la ruta más barata y dónde están los entrenadores. Probadas hasta el tope de la beta; lo de arriba del 30 sin probar.","en":"1–300 guides per profession, the cheapest route and trainer locations. Tested up to the beta cap; above 30 untested."}},{"site":"classicwowforever.com","url":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/","note":{"es":"Guías de leveo paso a paso y la lista completa de recetas con cómo se aprende cada una.","en":"Step-by-step leveling guides and the full recipe list with how each one is learned."}},{"site":"endgametools.com","url":"https://endgametools.com/en/wow-forever/leveling","note":{"es":"Planificador 1–300 con cantidad de pasos y de crafteos por profesión.","en":"1–300 planner with step and craft counts per profession."}}],"sources":["https://classicwowforever.com/professions/","https://classicwowforever.com/professions/best/shaman/","https://www.wow-professions.com/forever","https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","https://theforeverera.com/en/guides/classes/shaman/","https://wago.tools","https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/feedback-professions/2356010 — foro oficial de la beta / official beta forum","https://theforeverera.com/en/guides/choose-professions/ — piezas de cada profesión en el mejor equipo / pieces per profession in best gear","https://lfcarry.com/guides/wow-forever-restoration-shaman-pve — Restoration: Alchemy + Enchanting","https://classicwowforever.com/class-guides/shaman/restoration/ — encantamientos y consumibles de Restoration / Restoration enchants and consumables","https://classicwowforever.com/professions/cooking/ — cocina / cooking","https://classicwowforever.com/professions/fishing/ — pesca / fishing","https://classicwowforever.com/professions/bandages/ — primeros auxilios / first aid"],"caveat":{"es":"Datos de la beta: recetas, costos de Favor y fuentes de patrones pueden cambiar antes del lanzamiento. Las listas de crafteos salen del cliente; cómo se aprende cada receta, de classicwowforever.com (que cita Wowhead Forever y el datamine de Daybreak Forever).","en":"Beta data: recipes, Favor costs and pattern sources may change before launch. The crafted item lists come from the client; how each recipe is learned comes from classicwowforever.com (which cites Wowhead Forever and the Daybreak Forever datamine)."},"secondary":{"intro":{"es":"Cocina, pesca y primeros auxilios no ocupan lugar de profesión principal, y en Forever pesan más que en Classic: la comida da un stat según tu spec y +5% de experiencia, y las pociones de curación ahora son de Primeros Auxilios.","en":"Cooking, fishing and first aid don't take a main profession slot, and in Forever they matter more than in Classic: food gives a stat for your spec and +5% experience, and healing potions now belong to First Aid."},"cooking":[{"fact":{"es":"La mayoría de las comidas de Classic ahora da un solo stat en vez de Aguante y Espíritu, y el valor sube por nivel: +1 al 1, +3 al 5, +5 al 15, +10 al 25, +15 al 35 y +20 al 45.","en":"Most Classic foods now give a single stat instead of Stamina and Spirit, rising with level: +1 at 1, +3 at 5, +5 at 15, +10 at 25, +15 at 35 and +20 at 45."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/cooking/"},{"fact":{"es":"Con Well Fed la experiencia por matar sube 5%. Lo dice el tooltip del cliente beta; classicwowforever aclara que depende de una opción del servidor, así que falta confirmarlo para el lanzamiento.","en":"While Well Fed, experience from kills goes up 5%. The beta client tooltip says so; classicwowforever notes it depends on a server setting, so it's unconfirmed for launch."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/cooking/"},{"fact":{"es":"El buff dura 15 minutos. El perk de Legacy Gourmand lo alarga 33% (3 rangos).","en":"The buff lasts 15 minutes. The Legacy perk Gourmand makes it 33% longer (3 ranks)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/cooking/"},{"fact":{"es":"Los licuados de Espíritu se compran con Merchant's Favor: Kalsey Sanden (Three Corners, Redridge) y Aza'bek (The Barrens), por 30 a 90 de Favor.","en":"Spirit smoothies are bought with Merchant's Favor: Kalsey Sanden (Three Corners, Redridge) and Aza'bek (The Barrens), for 30 to 90 Favor."},"confidence":"community-untested","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/cooking/"},{"fact":{"es":"18 recetas necesitan el Iron Oven del campamento (se arma con Cocina 300). Los materiales crudos ahora se apilan de a 20.","en":"18 recipes need the camp's Iron Oven (built with Cooking 300). Raw cooking materials now stack to 20."},"confidence":"community-untested","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/cooking/"}],"firstAid":[{"fact":{"es":"Las pociones de curación pasaron de Alchemy a Primeros Auxilios, de Minor Healing Potion hasta Major Healing Potion.","en":"Healing potions moved from Alchemy to First Aid, from Minor Healing Potion up to Major Healing Potion."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/bandages/"},{"fact":{"es":"Hay curas nuevas: antídotos contra venenos, cataplasmas contra enfermedades y torniquetes contra sangrados, cada una hasta cierto nivel.","en":"There are new cures: anti-venoms for poisons, poultices for diseases and tourniquets for bleeds, each up to a set level."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/bandages/"},{"fact":{"es":"Su objeto de campamento, el First Aid Kit, da Aguante a los que se sientan junto al fuego.","en":"Its camp object, the First Aid Kit, gives Stamina to those sitting by the fire."},"confidence":"community-untested","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/best/"}],"fishing":[{"fact":{"es":"El Fish Bowl del campamento da +8% a todos los atributos durante una hora; no se suma con Blessing of Kings. Se aprende con Pesca 20 en la quest Camping 101: Fishing (Paxton Ganter, Dun Morogh).","en":"The camp's Fish Bowl gives +8% to all attributes for an hour; it doesn't stack with Blessing of Kings. Learned at Fishing 20 from the quest Camping 101: Fishing (Paxton Ganter, Dun Morogh)."},"confidence":"community-untested","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/fishing/"},{"fact":{"es":"Pesca abastece las comidas de poder de ataque y de daño con hechizos (Mightfish Steak, Baked Salmon, Lobster Stew), las mejores de su nivel para Enhancement y Elemental.","en":"Fishing supplies the attack power and spell damage foods (Mightfish Steak, Baked Salmon, Lobster Stew), the best of their level for Enhancement and Elemental."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/fishing/"},{"fact":{"es":"El perk de Legacy Luremaster da 25% de chance de un pez extra si tenés un señuelo puesto (2 rangos).","en":"The Legacy perk Luremaster gives a 25% chance of an extra fish with a lure on (2 ranks)."},"confidence":"community-untested","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/fishing/"},{"fact":{"es":"Señuelos: Shiny Bauble (+25, lo vende Kilxx en Booty Bay), Nightcrawlers y Bright Baubles (+50 a +75) y Aquadynamic Fish Attractor (+100 por 5 min).","en":"Lures: Shiny Bauble (+25, sold by Kilxx in Booty Bay), Nightcrawlers and Bright Baubles (+50 to +75) and Aquadynamic Fish Attractor (+100 for 5 min)."},"confidence":"classic-assumed","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/fishing/"}]}}};
